<title>USA: Loral to buy AT&amp;T's Skynet for $712 mln.</title>
<headline>Loral to buy AT&amp;T's Skynet for $712 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loral Space &amp; Communications Ltd said on Wednesday it had entered into a definitive agreement to buy AT&amp;T Corp's SkyNet Satellite Services for $712.5 million in cash.</p>
</text>
